{"t":"PCAR","made":"2026-11-06 14:38","name":"PACCAR Inc","ko":null,"sector":"Industrials","industry":"Farm & Heavy Construction Machinery","employees":25900,"hq":"Bellevue, WA, United States","website":"https://www.paccar.com","summary_en":"PACCAR Inc designs, manufactures, and distributes light, medium, and heavy-duty commercial trucks in the United States, Canada, Australia, Mexico, Europe, Central and South America, and internationally. It operates through three segments: Truck, Parts, and Financial Services. The Truck segment designs, manufactures, and distributes trucks for the over-the-road and off-highway hauling of commercial and consumer goods; and diesel engine products. It sells its trucks through a network of independent dealers under the Kenworth, Peterbilt, and DAF nameplates. The Parts segment distributes aftermarket parts for trucks and related commercial vehicles. The Financial Services segment conducts full-service leasing operations under the PacLease trade name, as well as provides finance and leasing products and services to customers and dealers. This segment offers equipment financing and administrative support services for its franchisees; retail loan and leasing services for small, medium, and large commercial trucking companies, as well as independent owners/operators and other businesses; and truck inventory financing services to independent dealers. In addition, this segment offers loans and leases directly to customers for the acquisition of trucks and related equipment; and operates its own full-service lease outlets. The company manufactures and markets industrial winches under the Braden, Carco, and Gearmatic nameplates. PACCAR Inc was founded in 1905 and is headquartered in Bellevue, Washington.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"PACCAR Inc는 미국, 캐나다, 호주, 멕시코, 유럽, 중남미 및 국제적으로 소형, 중형 및 대형 상업용 트럭을 설계, 제조 및 유통합니다. 트럭, 부품, 금융 서비스의 세 가지 부문으로 운영됩니다. 트럭 부문은 상업용 및 소비재를 도로 및 도로에서 운반하는 트럭을 설계, 제조 및 유통합니다. 및 디젤 엔진 제품. Kenworth, Peterbilt 및 DAF 명판 아래 독립 딜러 네트워크를 통해 트럭을 판매합니다. 부품 부문은 트럭 및 관련 상용차용 애프터마켓 부품을 유통합니다. 금융 서비스 부문은 PacLease 상표명으로 풀 서비스 임대 운영을 수행할 뿐만 아니라 고객과 딜러에게 금융 및 임대 제품과 서비스를 제공합니다. 이 부문은 가맹점을 위한 장비 금융 및 행정 지원 서비스를 제공합니다. 소규모, 중간 및 대규모 상업용 트럭 운송 회사뿐만 아니라 독립 소유주/운영자 및 기타 기업을 위한 소매 대출 및 임대 서비스; 독립 딜러에게 트럭 재고 금융 서비스를 제공합니다. 또한 이 부문은 트럭 및 관련 장비 구입을 위해 고객에게 직접 대출 및 임대를 제공합니다. 자체 풀 서비스 임대 매장을 운영하고 있습니다. 이 회사는 Braden, Carco 및 Gearmatic 명판으로 산업용 윈치를 제조 및 판매합니다. PACCAR Inc는 1905년에 설립되었으며 워싱턴 주 벨뷰에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":104.5,"mcap":55019806720.0,"pe":19.942749,"fpe":15.225401,"peg":0.7589,"ps":1.8919828,"pb":2.628534,"ev_ebitda":16.792,"div":1.34,"beta":0.957,"hi52":139.24,"lo52":93.86},"fin":{"rev":29080500224.0,"rev_g":0.19,"eps_g":0.436,"gross":0.1421,"op":0.12585,"net":0.094969995,"roe":0.13706,"fcf":1735624960.0,"cash":9238200320.0,"debt":15101200384.0,"de":72.152,"eps":5.24,"feps":6.86353},"own":{"short":0.0275,"inst":0.7578,"insider":0.01858},"analyst":{"n":16,"mean":126.875,"median":121.5,"high":162.0,"low":104.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":2.10526,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":3,"buy":7,"hold":9,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":3,"buy":7,"hold":9,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":3,"buy":5,"hold":10,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":1,"buy":5,"hold":13,"sell":0,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-10-31","Firm":"Freedom Broker","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Hold","Action":"up","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":120.0,"priorPriceTarget":132.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-28","Firm":"JP Morgan","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":132.0,"priorPriceTarget":142.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-28","Firm":"Truist Securities","ToGrade":"Hold","FromGrade":"Hold","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":124.0,"priorPriceTarget":125.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-12","Firm":"Citigroup","ToGrade